  "2026-07-26T22:41:26.228Z","harness:opencode","Pass complete. Coverage: walked all 13 capability epics + 4 initiatives + 6-milestone ladder (308 open items) against the product principles; every principle maps to living tracked work (CLI simplification pm-n7rr, token budgets pm-5t33or/pm-cu1i, context engine pm-4k6b/pm-atfm, SDK-first pm-usfg, provable history pm-w7ccmv/pm-9yfo, multi-agent merge pm-dj98/pm-76dnfg, CI detection pm-zclzll/pm-rtn5h6/pm-a8lnoh, harness attribution pm-z9x1r2, RL substrate pm-nfrhf0, composability pm-m9xv/pm-psy1, scale spectrum pm-z436/pm-g2zz). Verified live: release pipeline (evidence on pm-7zs0), harness auto-attribution (this session ran authorless). Filed 3 dedupe-checked gaps: pm-a5w7vv (NL intent, far), pm-0d7ord (render-ready export/dashboard, far), pm-hipfu9 (recurring reminders, near-mid) — 18 typed edges added, all three resolve to outcome milestones. Fixed one organizational defect: pm-7zs0 carried zero reminders despite describing a daily check; first fire scheduled 2026-07-27T06:00Z. Gates: pm validate history_drift ok 0/2117; health 0 warnings (pre-existing resolution-evidence warning stays mapped to pm-e9zh); graph audit 0 isolated/0 degree<=1 active nodes across 2120 nodes/9260 edges. Roadmap body updated with dated section per pm-zeifd2."
